<title>USA: PNC authorizes stock buyback.</title>
<headline>PNC authorizes stock buyback.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>PNC Bank Corp said on Monday that its board has authorized the repurchase of up to 15 million shAres of common stock in open market transactions.</p>
<p>The purchases will be made in addition to other board-authorized programs, PNC said.</p>
<p>The exact number of shares outstanding was not immediately available.</p>
<p>As of the end of the company's fourth quarter, the company had about 338.7 million fully diluted shares outstanding.  </p>
<p>A PNC spokesman said the company has 322,038,350 primary shares issued and outstanding as of February 24.</p>
